    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Daily routine",
     "texto": [
      "**每天** means every day; **早** means early and **晚**, late. **起床** means to get up and **睡觉**, to sleep or to go to bed.",
      "**早餐**, **午饭** and **晚饭** are breakfast, lunch and dinner. **吃饭** means to eat or to have a meal; **休息**, to rest."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
