     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Frequency and order",
     "texto": [
      "**常常** means «often» and **总是**, «always». **然后** means «then» and links actions. In Mandarin the verb doesn't change for «I get up», «you get up» or «she gets up», unlike English «gets»."
